message: "If you use this software or the pretrained models, please cite the associated publication."
title: "ActiTect & RBDisco: Wrist-Actigraphy Toolkit and RBD Prediction"
abstract: >
  ActiTect provides general-purpose wrist-actigraphy processing through a CLI and API;
  RBDisco adds pretrained screening models for REM sleep behavior disorder.
type: software

